<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,440.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,440.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,440 today from 1,434 on Feb 11, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1499    13.606	  1493    13.557</p>
<p>   1a   1507 11413.000	  1505 11400.000</p>
<p>   2    1776    25.375	  1764    25.207</p>
<p>   2a   1847 15144.000	  1847 15150.000</p>
